# ── Generated evaluation outputs — do not commit ────────────────────────────
#
# These files are produced by `leaderboard/evaluate.py` and the `task_*.py`
# scripts at runtime. Versioned copies (`_1`, `_2`, ...) are kept by
# `scorer.versioned_output_path()` / `versioned_output_pair()` so old runs are
# never overwritten — but none of them belong in version control.
#
# Only the *source* files (evaluate.py, ground_truth.py, scorer.py,
# task_*.py, __init__.py, README.md, .gitignore) are tracked.

*_results*.csv
*_metrics*.json
results.csv
metrics.json
